{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國會眾議院外交事務委員會周四公佈文件稱，截至2026年5月，美國商務部下屬負責出口管制與執法的工業與安全局，已批准向阿里巴巴、騰訊等中國企業出售超過87.9萬枚人工智能晶片。該消息在美國對華晶片出口管制持續受到審視的背景下公佈，引發國會兩黨對相關政策執行情況的強烈質疑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587228.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.212571+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:19:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"6726732f1f885057057f1c09d86bf21aa0b9fcb89f3eb61fcaed734a68e7ddab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}